  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『新機動戦記ガンダム W Endless Waltz』より、カトキハジメ氏完全監修の下、ウイングガンダムゼロEW Ver.Kaが登場！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam W Endless Waltz\", Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka appears under the full supervision of Hajime Katoki!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 完全新規造形で立体化。",
      "en": "• Three-dimensional with completely new modeling."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 関節各所の徹底検証を行い、“白い翼”の展開・連動ギミック、ツインバスターライフル射撃ポーズを追求。",
      "en": "• Thoroughly inspecting each joint to pursue the deployment and interlocking gimmick of the \"white wings\" and twin buster rifle shooting pose."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新規ギミックとして翼へのツインバスターライフルの収納と、ネオバード形態への変形を実現。",
      "en": "• As a new gimmick, the Twin Buster Rifle can be stored in the wings and transformed into Neo Bird form."
    }
  ],
